   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Come Closer**: back after 187 archived shows (3523 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Carried Away**: back after 25 archived shows (371 days) [3]\n- **Hopefully**: back after 95 archived shows (2053 days) [3]\n- **Touch me i'm going to scream (pt 1)**: back after 31 archived shows (415 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **O is the one that is real**: back after 31 archived shows (415 days) [3]\n- **Touch me i'm going to scream ( pt2 )**: back after 31 archived shows (415 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2012-08-12.Flac** (recommended): audience recording; 25 songs; 156 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer judges this likely the best Columbus show of the band to have circulated among traders on the site [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2012-08-12.Flac**: taped by Jim Mal; transferred by Jim Mal; source: Audience Berliner cm 33's > PMD 661 ( Oade Mod) [1]. Also: The recording is an audience recording, shared in FLAC format [2]",
